cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If SignOff helps your work, cite it with these fields."
title: "SignOff (signoff-cli): five commit-time gates that make an agent's \"done\" provable"
abstract: >-
  SignOff is a commit-time verdict CLI for agent-assisted delivery. Five offline gates
  (tests really ran, coverage level, task queue conflicts, dangerous-action ledger,
  anti-slop documentation) return an exit code as the verdict, and each passing commit
  leaves a tamper-evident record (marker, signed trailer, hash-chained ledger, signed
  checkpoint with a publishable anchor).
authors:
  - name: "ayuanxx-max"
    alias: ayuanxx-max
version: 4.6.2
date-released: "2026-11-11"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ayuanxx-max/signoff-cli"
url: "https://www.npmjs.com/package/signoff-cli"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - agent
  - code-review
  - commit-gate
  - provenance
  - attestation
  - mcp
  - git-hooks
